      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're grieving the loss of a version of yourself that was tied to external validation. That grief is real, and it's okay to feel hollow right now—but the fact that you're still here, still walking, means something remains. The mirror might show a stranger, but that stranger is still breathing, still capable of becoming someone new. You don't have to rebuild the old reputation; you get to decide what matters now.",
